            <form method="dialog"><button class="lb-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form>
            <div class="lb-dialog-head">
              <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/480?img=32" alt="" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" />
              <div>
                <h4 id="lb-dialog-amara-lead-name">Amara Osei</h4>
                <p class="lb-title">Co-founder & CEO</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lb-bio">
              <p>Amara was a corporate controller for a decade, most recently at Shopify, where she closed the books for 40 subsidiaries. She founded Ledgerline in 2021 after one too many month-ends spent in pivot tables.</p><p>She still reviews every customer's first close personally.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="lb-dialog-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/amara-osei" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View LinkedIn profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </dialog>
        </li>
        <li class="lb-card">
          <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/480?img=11" alt="Jonas Lindqvist" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="lb-card-body">
            <h4>Jonas Lindqvist</h4>
            <p class="lb-title">Co-founder & CTO</p>
            <div class="lb-actions">
              <button type="button" class="lb-open" data-dialog="lb-dialog-jonas-lead" aria-haspopup="dialog">Read bio<span class="visually-hidden"> of Jonas Lindqvist</span></button>
              <a class="lb-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonas-lindqvist" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Jonas Lindqvist on LinkedIn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.98 3.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0 5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5zM3 9.5h4V21H3zM9.5 9.5h3.8v1.6h.1c.5-1 1.8-2 3.8-2 4 0 4.8 2.6 4.8 6V21h-4v-5.2c0-1.2 0-2.9-1.8-2.9s-2 1.4-2 2.8V21h-4z"/></svg></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <dialog class="lb-dialog" id="lb-dialog-jonas-lead" aria-labelledby="lb-dialog-jonas-lead-name">
            <form method="dialog"><button class="lb-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form>
            <div class="lb-dialog-head">
              <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/480?img=11" alt="" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" />
              <div>
                <h4 id="lb-dialog-jonas-lead-name">Jonas Lindqvist</h4>
                <p class="lb-title">Co-founder & CTO</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lb-bio">
              <p>Jonas led payments infrastructure at Klarna and built his first double-entry ledger at nineteen for his parents' hardware store in Uppsala. He runs Ledgerline's engineering team from Stockholm and San Francisco.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="lb-dialog-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonas-lindqvist" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View LinkedIn profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </dialog>
        </li>
        <li class="lb-card">
          <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/480?img=45" alt="Priya Raman" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" />
