            <form method="dialog"><button class="lb-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form>
            <div class="lb-dialog-head">
              <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/480?img=32" alt="" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" />
              <div>
                <h4 id="lb-dialog-amara-board-name">Amara Osei</h4>
                <p class="lb-title">Board chair</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lb-bio">
              <p>Amara was a corporate controller for a decade, most recently at Shopify, where she closed the books for 40 subsidiaries. She founded Ledgerline in 2021 after one too many month-ends spent in pivot tables.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="lb-dialog-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/amara-osei" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View LinkedIn profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </dialog>
