            <form method="dialog"><button class="lb-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form>
            <div class="lb-dialog-head">
              <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/480?img=20" alt="" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" />
              <div>
                <h4 id="lb-dialog-helen-board-name">Helen Park</h4>
                <p class="lb-title">Board member</p>
          <p class="lb-aff">General Partner, Foundry Ventures</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lb-bio">
              <p>Helen invests in financial infrastructure at Foundry Ventures and led Ledgerline's Series A. Before investing she was VP of Finance at Gusto.</p>
            </div>
